{"id": "EUVD-2026-105315", "enisaUuid": "bc1b7905-6554-3cd8-b89a-a45a8509dab5", "description": "When writing a long cookie name and value to a Netscape cookie jar, a remote\nHTTP server can make `curl` write a record that exceeds its line-length\nparsing limit. Consequently, any subsequent `curl` invocation reading from\nthat same cookie jar using `--cookie` silently aborts parsing prematurely upon\nencountering the too long line, ignoring all subsequent valid cookies in the\nfile.", "datePublished": "2026-10-20T20:17:37", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-20T20:17:37", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://curl.se/docs/CVE-2026-92386.json", "https://curl.se/docs/CVE-2026-92386.html", "https://hackerone.com/reports/4021979"], "aliases": ["GHSA-4hjw-pggv-qwfj", "CVE-2026-92386"], "assigner": "curl", "epss": 0.29, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "25ac251b-2362-31ab-94c8-9792984fc642", "product": {"name": "curl", "vendor": {"name": "curl"}}, "product_version": "8.10.0 \u22648.10.0"}, {"id": "28efe5cd-8d6b-35aa-8c99-677780dfe37e", "product": {"name": "curl", "vendor": {"name": "curl"}}, "product_version": "8.13.0 \u22648.13.0"}, {"id": "37472d16-1b16-3de2-b5d8-a90409a4c36e", "product": {"name": "curl", "vendor": {"name": "curl"}}, "product_version": "8.22.0 \u22648.22.0"}, {"id": "389f8fd9-43d7-3bcd-acde-cc729a9ac401", "product": {"name": "curl", "vendor": {"name": "curl"}}, "product_version": "8.17.0 \u22648.17.0"}, {"id": "3ca1643a-3167-3ebd-8aed-d6da8c1ce7ed", "product": {"name": "curl", "vendor": {"name": "curl"}}, "product_version": "8.18.0 \u22648.18.0"}, {"id": "3d52f8b4-0483-375e-a9c6-52c54a8aee84", "product": {"name": "curl", "vendor": {"name": "curl"}}, "product_version": "8.21.0 \u22648.21.0"}, {"id": "3dea1a99-19fd-308d-ab66-f2b8fba71649", "product": {"name": "curl", "vendor": {"name": "curl"}}, "product_version": "8.8.0 \u22648.8.0"}, {"id": "42a14096-5e75-3ff0-b998-7bc3fe486c22", "product": {"name": "curl", "vendor": {"name": "curl"}}, "product_version": "8.9.0 \u2264